OL,5,G2310 RFDS: Royal Flying Doctor Service
OL,6,     FThe team attend a retrieval for a
OL,7,     Fpatient with Down syndrome, Mira
OL,8,     Fquestions her place in Wayne's
OL,9,     Fworld and a mediation attempt
OL,10,     Fbetween Annya and Poppy takes a
OL,11,     Fturn for the worse.
OL,12,G0005 The Light in the Hall
OL,13,     FIn 2002 Joe Pritchard was
OL,14,     Fimprisoned, for killing Ela
OL,15,     FRoberts, a young girl from
OL,16,     FLlanemlyn.
OL,17,G0100 The Rumour
OL,18,     FDebbie is desperate for Joanne to
OL,19,     Fcontinue investigating next-door
OL,20,     Fneighbour Sonia. Joanne is
OL,21,     Fterrified that Michael has arrived
OL,22,     Fto take Alfie away.
